'''Aromatisse''' (Japanese: '''フレフワン''' ''Frefuwan'') is a {{ct|Psychic}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

