==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|BREAKpoint|Aromatisse|85}} from the {{TCG|BREAKpoint}} expansion.
*'''Confounding Cologne''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Obsidian Flames|Oinkologne|183}} from the {{TCG|Obsidian Flames}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

